msgid "To cancel every open order at once, `POST /matcher/orderbook/cancel` takes `{\"sender\": <public key>, \"timestamp\": <ms>, \"signature\": <signature of the public key bytes and the big-endian timestamp>}`."
msgstr "Para cancelar cada pedido abierto a la vez, `POST /matcher/orderbook/cancel` toma `{\"sender\": <public key>, \"timestamp\": <ms>, \"signature\": <signature of the public key bytes and the big-endian timestamp>}`."

